### 1. GET all books
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books

### 2. GET one book
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books/2

### 3. POST - add a book
POST http://localhost:8000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Florante at Laura",
  "author": "Francisco Balagtas",
  "year": 1838
}

### 4. PUT - update a book
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 1888
}

### 5. DELETE - remove a book
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/books/3

### 6. GET a book that does not exist (404)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books/99